    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Echoes of a Dying Realm</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869850/extras/2b7e3cb09f173776f2028deca53fa549.poster.avif?t=1754910064\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869850/extras/2b7e3cb09f173776f2028deca53fa549.webm?t=1754910064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Step into a world beyond repair, where only the strongest persevere.<br><br>Lorn Vale is a free-roaming post-apocalyptic Survival Sandbox RPG. Can you endure the merciless cruelty of a land on the brink of oblivion? Your mission is to survive, climb the food chain, and carve out a living by any means necessary.<br><br>Your journey is shaped by every choice and action you take, ensuring that no two playthroughs are ever the same.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight for Survival</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869850/extras/65ade3e77a92e345bb0437cac434bfb9.poster.avif?t=1754910064\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869850/extras/65ade3e77a92e345bb0437cac434bfb9.webm?t=1754910064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Feel the tension as you engage in real-time tactical combat. <br>Every encounter is a test of your skill and wits, where survival is never granted, and sometimes you barely make it through the day (or night).<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Adapt and Overcome</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869850/extras/cc650edab79ada841cb59b82cfff690c.poster.avif?t=1754910064\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869850/extras/cc650edab79ada841cb59b82cfff690c.webm?t=1754910064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Every choice plays a key part in creating your own unique character. <br><br>Customize your stats and skills, pick from several backgrounds, experiment with game-changing mutations, and even form alliances with a multitude of different factions.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive in a Ruined World</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869850/extras/d7ecac71a0d07f8c1aaa6bc8aa4b6d21.poster.avif?t=1754910064\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869850/extras/d7ecac71a0d07f8c1aaa6bc8aa4b6d21.webm?t=1754910064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Explore the barren wastelands and encounter the eccentric residents who have no choice but to call it home. <br><br>Trade with wandering caravans, pick up bounties and find refuge in what few towns still exist. Experience a savage, handcrafted open-world where the map stays the same, but encounters and events are always different.",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Echoes of a Dying Realm</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869850/extras/2b7e3cb09f173776f2028deca53fa549.poster.avif?t=1754910064\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869850/extras/2b7e3cb09f173776f2028deca53fa549.webm?t=1754910064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Step into a world beyond repair, where only the strongest persevere.<br><br>Lorn Vale is a free-roaming post-apocalyptic Survival Sandbox RPG. Can you endure the merciless cruelty of a land on the brink of oblivion? Your mission is to survive, climb the food chain, and carve out a living by any means necessary.<br><br>Your journey is shaped by every choice and action you take, ensuring that no two playthroughs are ever the same.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight for Survival</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869850/extras/65ade3e77a92e345bb0437cac434bfb9.poster.avif?t=1754910064\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869850/extras/65ade3e77a92e345bb0437cac434bfb9.webm?t=1754910064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Feel the tension as you engage in real-time tactical combat. <br>Every encounter is a test of your skill and wits, where survival is never granted, and sometimes you barely make it through the day (or night).<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Adapt and Overcome</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869850/extras/cc650edab79ada841cb59b82cfff690c.poster.avif?t=1754910064\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869850/extras/cc650edab79ada841cb59b82cfff690c.webm?t=1754910064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Every choice plays a key part in creating your own unique character. <br><br>Customize your stats and skills, pick from several backgrounds, experiment with game-changing mutations, and even form alliances with a multitude of different factions.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive in a Ruined World</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869850/extras/d7ecac71a0d07f8c1aaa6bc8aa4b6d21.poster.avif?t=1754910064\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869850/extras/d7ecac71a0d07f8c1aaa6bc8aa4b6d21.webm?t=1754910064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Explore the barren wastelands and encounter the eccentric residents who have no choice but to call it home. <br><br>Trade with wandering caravans, pick up bounties and find refuge in what few towns still exist. Experience a savage, handcrafted open-world where the map stays the same, but encounters and events are always different.",
    "short_description": "A free-roaming post-apocalyptic Survival Sandbox RPG in which you must weather the unrelenting brutality of a dying world. Shape your own unique journey, forge alliances. Make difficult choices in this systems-driven game full of procedurally generated events. Amidst the ruins, your story begins.",
